      "statement": "The coefficient majorants imply |bᵢ|≤q^(n−1), hence |βᵢ|≤q^((n−1)/2). The provider passes |β|≤q^(n/2) to the zeta sum. The parameter multiset at the other CM place is the inverse and its residue cardinality agrees, giving the same needed bound on |β⁻¹|.",
